    "id": 708060,
    "branch": "main/optimize_spawn_distribution",
    "changeset": "166803",
    "created": "2026-10-05T22:19:31",
    "message": "Reduce memory usage of the server's SpawnDistributions by 750MB (780MB -> 40MB) and make it 3x faster to sample (2.1 us -> 0.7 us)\n- store in tiles of 16x16 values\n- 85% of the tiles are all zeros (fun fact)\n- tiles that are all the same value store as negative tile index so it can avoid looking up the tile (mainly all zeros)\n- deduplicate the remaining tiles (saves a little more)\n- palette packing on top for tiles that have mixed values (2 - 4 bits / value)\n- reduces server startup time from 4s -> 2.5s",
    "user": "Jake_Rich"
  },
