    "changeset": "166689",
    "created": "2026-10-03T19:48:45",
    "message": "Optimize path following further following Daniel's leads:\r\n- support full batching, serial path no longer needed even if some NPCs can swim or open doors, move requests are queued for next batch\r\n- better use of unity's TransformAccessArray to avoid native overhead (don't set to null, do not re-build every batch instead persistent w stable identities)\r\n- iterate forward instead of backward (ListHashSet is slower backward, + has RemoveUnordered so iterating backward to delete is not really needed)\r\n- skip IsUnityNull checks that's no longer needed",
    "user": "Maverick"
  }
